</node>
<node id="Second Battle of St. Albans">
  <data key="d0">Second Battle of St. Albans</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Second Battle of St. Albans was a significant conflict in February 1461, where the Lancastrians defeated Warwick’s forces.&lt;SEP&gt;The Second Battle of St. Albans, fought in 1461, was a conflict during the Wars of the Roses where the Lancastrians defeated Warwick.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfa85355242315f033b4bb60edaa01d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1b4523d0ab404d11474869db22319af</data>
