<node id="Henry Tudor">
  <data key="d0">Henry Tudor</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Henry Tudor, later known as Henry VII, was the victor of the Battle of Bosworth Field, which concluded the Wars of the Roses.&lt;SEP&gt;Henry Tudor, later known as Henry VII, was the first monarch of the House of Tudor who ended the Wars of the Roses by defeating Richard III at the Battle of Bosworth Field.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfa85355242315f033b4bb60edaa01d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e57cd1e078760fff38d084350f5e77</data>
  <data key="d4">wars_of_the_roses.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1774834673</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Edward III">
  <data key="d0">Edward III</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Edward III was the King of England whose lineage provided claims to the throne for both the House of Lancaster and the House of York during the Wars of the Roses.&lt;SEP&gt;Edward III was a King of England, the ancestor from whom both the Houses of Lancaster and York claimed their descent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfa85355242315f033b4bb60edaa01d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e57cd1e078760fff38d084350f5e77</data>
  <data key="d4">wars_of_the_roses.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1774834673</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
