  <data key="d0">Richard Neville, Earl of Warwick</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Richard Neville, known as the Earl of Warwick, was a leading figure in the Wars of the Roses who supported the Yorkist claim to the throne and had significant military influence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfa85355242315f033b4bb60edaa01d2</data>
