<node id="Warwick">
  <data key="d0">Warwick</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Warwick, known as the Kingmaker, was a significant figure in the Wars of the Roses, supporting the Yorkist claim while opposing the Lancastrians.</data>
