  <data key="d3">chunk-a1b4523d0ab404d11474869db22319af</data>
  <data key="d2">Margaret and Henry are linked as a part of the royal family opposing Edward IV in the conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Henry and Margaret are linked as the royal couple associated with the Lancastrians during the Wars of the Roses.</data>
