<node id="Sulfonylureas">
  <data key="d0">Sulfonylureas</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfonylureas are a class of oral drugs that stimulate insulin release from beta cells in the pancreas to control blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfonylureas are a class of oral diabetes medications that stimulate insulin secretion from pancreatic beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13061af8ceaf1fb5f240b0dc1225d36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4db05eeb2c79e26d860c7775f19359</data>
  <data key="d4">diabetes_insulin_therapies.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1774838947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Biguanides">
  <data key="d0">Biguanides</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Biguanides are a class of oral drugs, primarily metformin, that decrease glucose production in the liver and increase insulin action on tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;Biguanides are another class of oral drugs used for blood glucose control in diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13061af8ceaf1fb5f240b0dc1225d36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4db05eeb2c79e26d860c7775f19359</data>
  <data key="d4">diabetes_insulin_therapies.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1774838947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thiazolidinediones">
  <data key="d0">Thiazolidinediones</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Thiazolidinediones are a class of oral drugs that reduce insulin resistance and increase glucose transport in muscle and adipose tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;Thiazolidinediones are oral medications utilized to improve insulin sensitivity and control blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13061af8ceaf1fb5f240b0dc1225d36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4db05eeb2c79e26d860c7775f19359</data>
  <data key="d4">diabetes_insulin_therapies.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1774838947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glipizide">
  <data key="d0">Glipizide</data>
  <data key="d1">drug</data>
  <data key="d2">Glipizide is a specific sulfonylurea used to lower blood glucose levels by stimulating insulin release.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13061af8ceaf1fb5f240b0dc1225d36f</data>
  <data key="d4">diabetes_insulin_therapies.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1774838947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
